      "cooked": "<p>Hi folks!</p>\n<p>So, I decided to make a poll for <em>Spirit Island</em>’s <a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=List_of_Scenarios\">Scenarios</a>, because why not?</p>\n<p>Here it is: <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/15e40dc64f4f97c83b50ce286d8051af06fc7850.png?v=12\" title=\":plant:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom\" alt=\":plant:\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdfIpA5pCmopPtPmYbp1D_L4gMnBd9Iz2cRfrniOUf0fF_gaQ/viewform?usp=sharing\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Spirit Island Scenarios Poll</a> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7abe67099d9621b9331c20610436e33e91958505.png?v=12\" title=\":water:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom\" alt=\":water:\"></p>\n<p>I’ll post the result here in one week’s time or thereabouts.</p>\n<p>And, of course, feel free to explain or elaborate upon your answers in this thread!</p>\n<p>Cheers!</p>",
