      "username": "fjur",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-05-10T00:34:13.845Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Intriguing, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/trajector\">@Trajector</a>. About how much difficulty would you estimate it adds?</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Anyways, more than a week has gone by, and I don’t expect to see any more submissions to the poll, so I might as well post the results.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Results</strong></p>\n<p><strong>How often do you play with any Scenario?</strong><br>\nVery Rarely (2), Rarely (1), Sometimes (1)</p>\n<p><strong>How often have you played each Scenario?</strong></p>\n <table>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n    <th>Scenario</th>\n    <th>Never</th>\n    <th>Very Rarely</th>\n    <th>Rarely</th>\n    <th>Sometimes</th>\n    <th>Often</th>\n    <th>Very Often</th>\n    <th>Always</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Blitz</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Dahan Insurrection</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Guard the Isle's Heart</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Rituals of Terror</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>4</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Second Wave</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Powers Long Forgotten</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Ward the Shores</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>4</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Rituals of the Destroying Flame</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>4</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Elemental Invocation</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Despicable Theft</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n  \n<tr>\n    <td>The Great River</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>A Diversity of Spirits</td>\n    <td>4</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Varied Terrains</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table> \n<p><strong>How much fun do you have playing each Scenario?</strong></p>\n <table>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n    <th>Scenario</th>\n    <th>Terrible</th>\n    <th>Not Fun</th>\n    <th>Somewhat Fun</th>\n    <th>Fun</th>\n    <th>Very Fun</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Blitz</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Dahan Insurrection</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Guard the Isle's Heart</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Rituals of Terror</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Second Wave</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Powers Long Forgotten</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Ward the Shores</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Rituals of the Destroying Flame</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Elemental Invocation</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Despicable Theft</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n  \n<tr>\n    <td>The Great River</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>A Diversity of Spirits</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Varied Terrains</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Analysis</strong></p>\n<p>A Diversity of Spirits is the only Scenario which apparently no one (who took the poll) has ever played. Contrarily, Dahan Insurrection is the only Scenario that anyone (specifically, a single respondent) plays “Often.” Rituals of Terror, Ward the Shores, and Rituals of the Destroying Flame also seem relatively unpopular. And, as expected, the <em>Jagged Earth</em> Scenarios have all been played less then those from the base game and <em>Branch &amp; Claw</em>.</p>\n<p>Meanwhile, in the realm of funness, A Diversity of Spirits is still the least popular, being rated as the only Scenario to be “Terrible,” and it’s even 100% so. Simultaneously, Blitz, Dahan Insurrection, and Guard the Isle’s Heart are the only three to be rated as “Very Fun,” with one respondent saying so for each.</p>",
