      "raw": "Intriguing, @Trajector. About how much difficulty would you estimate it adds?\n\n---\n\nAnyways, more than a week has gone by, and I don't expect to see any more submissions to the poll, so I might as well post the results.\n\n---\n\n**Results**\n\n**How often do you play with any Scenario?**\nVery Rarely (2), Rarely (1), Sometimes (1)\n\n**How often have you played each Scenario?**\n <table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Scenario</th>\n    <th>Never</th>\n    <th>Very Rarely</th>\n    <th>Rarely</th>\n    <th>Sometimes</th>\n    <th>Often</th>\n    <th>Very Often</th>\n    <th>Always</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Blitz</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Dahan Insurrection</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Guard the Isle's Heart</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Rituals of Terror</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>4</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Second Wave</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Powers Long Forgotten</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n<tr>\n    <td>Ward the Shores</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>4</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Rituals of the Destroying Flame</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>4</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Elemental Invocation</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Despicable Theft</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>The Great River</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>A Diversity of Spirits</td>\n    <td>4</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Varied Terrains</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n</table> \n\n**How much fun do you have playing each Scenario?**\n <table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Scenario</th>\n    <th>Terrible</th>\n    <th>Not Fun</th>\n    <th>Somewhat Fun</th>\n    <th>Fun</th>\n    <th>Very Fun</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Blitz</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Dahan Insurrection</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Guard the Isle's Heart</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Rituals of Terror</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Second Wave</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Powers Long Forgotten</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n<tr>\n    <td>Ward the Shores</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Rituals of the Destroying Flame</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Elemental Invocation</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Despicable Theft</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>The Great River</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>1</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>A Diversity of Spirits</td>\n    <td>2</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td>Varied Terrains</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>3</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n    <td>0</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n---\n\n**Analysis**\n\nA Diversity of Spirits is the only Scenario which apparently no one (who took the poll) has ever played. Contrarily, Dahan Insurrection is the only Scenario that anyone (specifically, a single respondent) plays \"Often.\" Rituals of Terror, Ward the Shores, and Rituals of the Destroying Flame also seem relatively unpopular. And, as expected, the *Jagged Earth* Scenarios have all been played less then those from the base game and *Branch & Claw*.\n\nMeanwhile, in the realm of funness, A Diversity of Spirits is still the least popular, being rated as the only Scenario to be \"Terrible,\" and it's even 100% so. Simultaneously, Blitz, Dahan Insurrection, and Guard the Isle's Heart are the only three to be rated as \"Very Fun,\" with one respondent saying so for each.",
