      "raw": "[quote=\"fjur, post:4, topic:30036\"]\nIntriguing, @Trajector. About how much difficulty would you estimate it adds?\n[/quote]\n\nI don't have enough breadth of play with scenarios or adversaries to give a really good feel of that. But, maybe...2? Ish? And it can be highly Spirit-dependant in that some are definitely less mobile (or want to be less mobile), which stretches our ability to control the board. There's a section of the Jagged Earth rulebook that deals with having an extra island board, as there are a few extra considerations (like not placing initial Invaders, extra Blight starting on the Blight Card, or specifying that \"once per board\" things do happen extra times). The book also suggests that adding an extra island board adds more extra difficulty at higher initial difficulties, in a compounding effect.",
